<title>Myanmar's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/myanmar/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-myanmar-2026-10-28T13:18:38.484Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 13:18:38 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The junta continues airstrikes, recently bombing a Karen village and damaging homes and vehicles, while also attacking two naval vessels on the Kaladan River, which were reported sunk. Thai authorities announced that an ASEAN envoy will visit Myanmar, and the US is reported to be undermining the EU diplomatic blockade on the junta. The regime has imprisoned two Islamic teachers and seized a mosque, and a Molotov attack on a Myanmar refugee settlement led to four charges, while a Chinese employer was killed in an alleged attack by four Myanmar workers and a Myanmar woman died after being hit by a pickup in Chalong. The conflict caused 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/myanmar-is-the-us-undermining-the-eu-s-diplomatic-blockade/a-79778863?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxPUnJZVlF5Nk44MkpjQUJveHZZczFuQWpndnlXdXgtZkhLem0wQ09vVmV4RVFYN1BYZzN6bFF3RS0zaDk1MjU0eENDYjVURTlKbEJzS2hlR3o1S3VUT2lCYWxrOEMwN043bVRkRV96N3dReURvQUlScW44bU9ZYTB1RXVIdC14WmVJaHZVLV9ueFplUTVaSDN4NEMyaGo?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxOVGdSN0toZHZUdF83RzFxOXg0OU1zVkU1OFJpOTlFVGF5NmFTbWxsUENuNkR4X0tuLXVNSDEyREo0NVMtMGxpampQdDdQQzA4RUJpV3ppemYtR081ZXBOcXBoTVZ2VVNHMHFuOGk1cWxETk9TdG4zTHVuZlFjaVhZQlpnOVV1TzFzcXc5cWIwekkzcS16ek16Zg?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxNSWl4SlBja1R4RkhhaTMxemplMld0aldQMmlzbzdsOVlPMnJFWVNwRVVMa1dnanFtOVctTlEyWjl0SnI4Q3I4TzQ4QU5LRjRtX3BKSXc2RE5tQTNRSWhKYXlvX01QdE1OZWlQc1d4ZkZwWWxVQTVGLUR1NWFVWjZYcFNvNDJXS1hOYXUtVWRQSkdwMVZ5MGtUcHpjUTI3TjZ6M0VZaUdhLVdSTzA5UXkyYXlWUTFyRHlXb0tF?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot